    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mn>15</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>We know that,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"\"><mrow><mtable><mtr><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr/></mtable></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Case&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo></math></p><p>When&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now if&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>5</mn></math>,&nbsp;then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p><p>And if&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>5</mn></math>,&nbsp;then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Case&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>:</mo></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now if&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>15</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Now for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>15</mn></math>, then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>&nbsp;<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"\"><mtable columnalign=\"left left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>5</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>20</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>5</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>10</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>10</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>15</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>30</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>15</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0100_2560e7afc383.png\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 194px;\" /></p><p>Now, it is clear from the graph of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;has sharp corners at<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>15</mn></math>&nbsp;and hence this function is not differentiable at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p>"
  }
}